      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "Azure",
      "experience_band": "3-5 years",
      "question": "When would you choose Azure Service Bus over a storage queue?",
      "answer": "Compare ordering, sessions, duplicate detection, dead-lettering, transactions, throughput, and operational needs against the workload. The best choice depends on required delivery semantics and service limits, not on a general claim that one is always better.",
