      "answer": "Set clear outcomes and ownership, delegate meaningful decisions with guardrails, and tailor coaching to each engineer. Review progress through observable results and regular feedback, addressing delivery risks early without taking over all implementation.",
      "example": "Pair on an initial design review, let the engineer own rollout and monitoring, then discuss results in a retrospective."
