      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "C# / .NET",
      "question": "What is inheritance?",
      "answer": "One-line: Inheritance lets a derived class reuse and specialize a base class.\n\n Interview answer: It models an is-a relationship, although I prefer composition when behaviors must vary independently.",
      "example": "🌳 Child inherits family features\n\nBase Class → Derived Class",
