      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "C# / .NET",
      "question": "What is polymorphism?",
      "answer": "One-line: One contract can execute different implementations.\n\n Interview answer: Runtime polymorphism is commonly achieved through interfaces or virtual method overriding.",
      "example": "🔌 Same socket, different devices\n\nInterface → Implementation A / B / C",
