      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "C# / .NET",
      "question": "Open Closed Principle?",
      "answer": "One-line: Software should be open for extension and closed for unnecessary modification.\n\n Interview answer: I extend behavior through strategies, interfaces, or composition rather than repeatedly changing stable code.",
      "example": "🔌 Add plug-in, do not rewire\n\nStable Core + Extension",
