      "question": "What is the CLR ThreadPool?",
      "answer": "One-line: The ThreadPool reuses workers for short asynchronous and parallel tasks.\n\nInterview answer: It scales worker and I/O completion threads dynamically, but blocking pool threads causes starvation and increased latency.",
