      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "C# / .NET",
      "question": "How do you cancel async work?",
      "answer": "One-line: Cancellation is cooperative and should be passed through the complete call chain.\n\nInterview answer: Use CancellationTokenSource and token parameters. Call ThrowIfCancellationRequested or catch OperationCanceledException where appropriate. Cancellation does not interrupt arbitrary unmanaged or blocked code.",
      "example": "🛑 Passenger requests stop, driver cooperates\n\nCreate token → pass token → ThrowIfCancellationRequested\n\nawait service.GetAsync(token);\n// service: await http.GetAsync(token);\n// CancelToken is passed to every async operation.",
