      "answer": "One-line: lock provides mutual exclusion; SemaphoreSlim limits concurrency and supports WaitAsync.\n\nInterview answer: Use lock for tiny synchronous critical sections. Use SemaphoreSlim when waiting for a resource across async calls, with finally around Release.",
