      "question": "Mutex versus Semaphore?",
      "answer": "One-line: A named mutex coordinates exclusive cross-process work; semaphores coordinate permit counts.\n\nInterview answer: Cross-process coordination is expensive and should be rare. Prefer an external database, distributed lock, lease, queue, or broker with timeouts and ownership fencing.",
