      "question": "Finalizer versus Dispose?",
      "answer": "One-line: Dispose is deterministic; finalization is not guaranteed at a specific time.\n\nInterview answer: Implement the standard disposal pattern when wrapping unmanaged resources. Suppress finalization after Dispose. Managed memory does not require a finalizer just to be collected.",
      "example": "🧯 Dispose is planned extinguishing; finalizer is emergency cleanup\n\nDispose now | GC finalizer later",
