      "example": "🧾 Commit a unit together; detect if someone changed the row first\n\n Read version V1 → another writer commits V2 → conditional update affects 0 rows → concurrency conflict\n\ntry\n{\n    order.ChangeAddress(request.Address);\n    await db.SaveChangesAsync(cancellationToken);\n}\ncatch (DbUpdateConcurrencyException)\n{\n    // Reload current state; merge or report a conflict intentionally.\n    return Results.Conflict(\"Order changed; refresh and try again.\");\n}",
      "practice_type": "Interview Q&A",
