      "topic": "Azure",
      "question": "Parameters vs variables?",
      "answer": "Answer: Parameters shape the expanded pipeline. Variables hold values used across pipeline scopes and runtime contexts.\n\nInterview answer: Parameters are best for template structure and typed choices; variables are best for values that flow through execution.",
