      "answer": "Answer: Capture exact error, failed task, correlation identifiers, and inputs; trace task to YAML, script, code, or configuration; separate automation and environment causes.\n\nInterview answer: I do not start from the last generic failure. I identify the first meaningful failure and follow evidence through logs and source.",
