      "question": "Example: SQL or NoSQL for a new app?",
      "answer": "Start with SQL when: relationships, transactions, uniqueness, reporting, and evolving query needs are important. Choose a non-relational model when: access patterns/data shape are clear and its partition/consistency model directly solves a requirement.\n\nWrite the top five reads/writes first. If you cannot state query patterns, scale, consistency, and failure expectations, you are not ready to choose based on a benchmark or label.",
      "example": "",
