      "question": "Functional requirements",
      "answer": "- Sellers create product offers with price and available quantity.\n\n- Shoppers browse, search, filter, and view product details.\n\n- Shoppers maintain a cart and submit an order with a delivery address.\n\n- The system reserves available stock, requests payment, and reports order status.\n\n- Shoppers can cancel eligible orders, request refunds, and track fulfillment.\n\n- Sellers fulfill orders; notifications communicate material status changes.",
