      "topic": "System Design",
      "question": "First release boundaries",
      "answer": "- One currency and a limited shipping region; one external payment provider.\n\n- No live auctions, warehouse robotics, recommendation ML, or multi-region active-active writes.\n\n- Simple seller tools and rule-based search; expand only when validated.\n\n- Use a payment provider; do not store raw card numbers or security codes.\n\nA boundary is a design input, not a claim that the omitted feature is unimportant.",
