      "question": "Model the important relationship",
      "answer": "Product 1—N Offer (many sellers can offer one product). Order 1—N OrderLine. Each order line snapshots product name, offer/seller, quantity, and agreed unit price; later catalog edits must not rewrite a completed purchase.",
