      "topic": "System Design",
      "question": "Why begin with a modular monolith?",
      "answer": "One deployable can still separate Catalog, Cart, Checkout, Inventory, and Payment modules behind explicit interfaces. It simplifies local transactions, deployment, and debugging while product boundaries are still changing.",
