      "id": "project-guide-55431236184a294002127f5c",
      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "System Design",
      "question": "When to split a service",
      "answer": "Split when a domain has a real independent scaling, release, ownership, or isolation need. Give each service clear write ownership. Expect network timeouts, versioned contracts, distributed tracing, data duplication, and eventual consistency as the cost.",
      "example": "",
      "practice_type": "Interview Q&A",
