      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "System Design",
      "question": "Abuse and application safety",
      "answer": "Validate input; protect against injection, CSRF, XSS, SSRF, credential stuffing, scraping, bots, and denial-of-service. Apply rate limits, fraud signals, safe output encoding, and security testing.",
