      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "System Design",
      "question": "Deploy and change data safely",
      "answer": "Build immutable artifacts, scan dependencies, and promote the same artifact through environments. Use canary/gradual rollout and automatic rollback signals. Evolve schemas with expand → deploy → backfill → contract so old and new application versions coexist.",
