      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "System Design",
      "question": "Disaster recovery",
      "answer": "Set recovery time objective (RTO) and recovery point objective (RPO) per domain. Backups are not proven until restored. Regularly rehearse zone/regional recovery, credential loss, event replay, and payment/order reconciliation.",
