      "answer": "Authentication asks “who is calling?” Authorization asks “may this caller perform this action on this specific resource?” A valid token does not permit Maya to read Leo's order.\n\nVerify issuer, audience, signature, expiration, and required claims. Enforce customer/seller ownership on the server for every object access. Do not trust client-supplied user IDs, seller IDs, price, role, or status.",
      "example": "",
