      "question": "Saga",
      "answer": "What it solves\n\nA multi-service business transaction without a distributed database transaction.\n\nIn the shop\n\nReserve stock → authorize payment → confirm order. If payment fails, release the reservation; if stock fails, do not capture payment. Each compensation is an explicit business action.",
