      "question": "CQRS",
      "answer": "What it solves\n\nLets write rules and high-volume read models evolve independently where workload justifies it.\n\nIn the shop\n\nCheckout writes an order to its authoritative store; a read projection serves the order-history screen. The projection may lag briefly, so the UI handles eventual consistency.",
