      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "System Design",
      "question": "Event sourcing",
      "answer": "What it solves\n\nStores an append-only sequence of domain events as the source of truth when audit and historical reconstruction justify the complexity.\n\nIn the shop\n\nAn order stream could record OrderCreated, InventoryReserved, and OrderConfirmed. It is not required just because the system publishes integration events.",
