      "question": "Circuit breaker",
      "answer": "What it solves\n\nStops repeatedly calling a failing dependency and gives it time to recover.\n\nIn the shop\n\nIf the recommendation service is down, open the breaker and render the product page without recommendations instead of delaying checkout.",
