      "question": "Idempotency",
      "answer": "What it solves\n\nMakes a repeated request safe when a client retries after a timeout or loses the response.\n\nIn the shop\n\nThe client sends an idempotency key with checkout. The service stores the key and result so a retry returns the same order instead of charging twice.",
