      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "System Design",
      "question": "State machine",
      "answer": "What it solves\n\nDefines valid state transitions and rejects impossible or duplicate actions.\n\nIn the shop\n\nAn order can move from PENDING_PAYMENT to CONFIRMED or CANCELLED; it cannot move from SHIPPED back to PAYMENT_PENDING.",
