      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "System Design",
      "question": "Dead-letter queue",
      "answer": "What it solves\n\nIsolates messages that still fail after bounded retries for inspection and safe replay.\n\nIn the shop\n\nA malformed shipment event is moved to a DLQ with diagnostics and an alert; operators fix the cause and replay it with duplicate protection.",
