      "topic": "System Design",
      "question": "Strategy, Factory, Builder, Repository",
      "answer": "What they solve\n\nKeep variation, object construction, and persistence details out of core business decisions.\n\nIn the shop\n\nA shipping strategy chooses a carrier by destination and promise; a factory creates the right carrier adapter; a builder assembles a complex shipment request; a repository persists the order aggregate behind a domain-facing interface.",
