      "topic": "System Design",
      "question": "Service discovery and observability",
      "answer": "What they solve\n\nFinds healthy service instances and makes cross-service behavior diagnosable.\n\nIn the shop\n\nRuntime routing targets healthy Inventory instances. A trace ID follows checkout across services; metrics track latency, errors, queue lag, and reservation failures.",
