      "answer": "Concepts: comparisons, Boolean operators, if/switch, pattern basics, and mutually exclusive rules\n\nDebugging: overlapping conditions, boundary values, and an unreachable branch\n\n\nOutcome: a decision table, implementation, and tests for each rule branch",
