      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "Behavioral",
      "concept": "Learning from mistakes",
      "question": "How would you discuss a technical mistake without blaming a teammate or claiming you never make errors?",
      "answer": "State the decision and missing assumption, explain your response, and describe a concrete learning or prevention step. Own the part you controlled while accurately describing shared responsibilities. Avoid exposing confidential customer or incident details in the example.",
