      "topic": "Behavioral",
      "concept": "Prioritization",
      "question": "How would you choose between a new feature, a production bug, and technical debt?",
      "answer": "Compare customer impact, urgency, safety, dependencies, and cost of delay. Make trade-offs visible and seek the appropriate decision owner when priorities conflict. Technical debt is easier to assess when tied to an observed delivery or reliability cost rather than a vague preference.",
