      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "Behavioral",
      "concept": "Stakeholder communication",
      "question": "How would you explain a reliability concern to a non-technical product owner?",
      "answer": "Translate it into user impact, likelihood, recoverability, and options with trade-offs. Avoid unsupported probabilities or jargon-heavy alarm. Recommend a proportionate next action and explain what evidence would justify more investment.",
      "example": "A duplicate submission can create a second order; a durable retry key reduces that risk without redesigning the whole product.",
