      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "Behavioral",
      "concept": "Disagreement and decisions",
      "question": "What should happen after the team chooses a reasonable approach different from your recommendation?",
      "answer": "Confirm the decision and its assumptions, support execution, and raise new evidence through the agreed review path. Do not sabotage the chosen design or pretend unresolved safety concerns disappeared. Distinguish ordinary technical preference from a genuine policy or correctness issue needing escalation.",
      "example": "Document the chosen option, the risks accepted, and the condition that would trigger reconsideration.",
