      "company": "Subject practice",
      "topic": "Behavioral",
      "concept": "Customer-focused debugging",
      "question": "How would you investigate a bug report you cannot reproduce locally?",
      "answer": "Clarify the observed user impact and gather safe environment, timing, and operation details. Compare relevant differences and form testable hypotheses. Avoid requesting unnecessary personal data or dismissing the report because a happy-path local run works.",
